*.DotSettings.user

# ============================================================
# .NET / C#
# ============================================================

# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/
[Dd]ebug/
[Dd]ebugPublic/
[Rr]elease/
[Rr]eleases/
